PackageIdentifier: crmne.TonePush
PackageVersion: @VERSION@
PackageLocale: en-US
Publisher: Carmine Paolino
PublisherUrl: https://paolino.me/
PublisherSupportUrl: https://github.com/crmne/tonepush/issues
Author: Carmine Paolino
PackageName: TonePush
PackageUrl: https://docs.tonepush.rocks/
License: MIT
LicenseUrl: https://github.com/crmne/tonepush/blob/v@VERSION@/LICENSE
Copyright: Copyright (c) 2026 Carmine Paolino
ShortDescription: Editor and tone library for Line 6 HX pedals and the StompStation PRO
Description: |-
  TonePush is an open-source editor for Line 6 HX-family devices and the Sonulab StompStation PRO: one GUI and one scriptable command-line tool. Edit presets block by block, keep your tones in a library you can search, audition a tone on the pedal before you keep it, build setlists, and back up the pedal.
  TonePush is not affiliated with Line 6, Yamaha or Sonulab.
Moniker: tonepush
